This npm package is a thin redirect: it re-exports the `tide` CLI surface
from the open-source @paean-ai/zero-cli package. All CLI source lives
upstream in @paean-ai/zero-cli.

Upstream attribution: see the LICENSE and NOTICE shipped with
@paean-ai/zero-cli (https://github.com/a8e-ai/zero-cli), which is itself
derived from Anthropic's Claude Code under the MIT License.

DeepTide is an independent project and is not affiliated with, endorsed
by, or sponsored by Anthropic, Inc.

Native runtime source under native/ds4 is a DeepSeek V4 Flash specific
inference engine that includes attribution to llama.cpp/GGML in
native/ds4/LICENSE and native/ds4/README.md. Native gateway source under
native/dsgo is distributed as part of this repository's source tree but is not
included in the npm package tarball unless package.json's files allowlist is
changed.
